            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Meeting notes that don't give up.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.29</h2>
<ul>
  <li>If writing a meeting's summary fails for a moment, Jarvis now tries again on its own, instead of leaving "Couldn't write a summary this time" until you press Try again.</li>
  <li>A summary that still failed is retried the next time Jarvis starts.</li>
  <li>Settings → Plan now shows checkout and billing-portal problems separately, so each message matches the button you pressed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
